# Current Capabilities

No product capability was inferred or claimed by workflow installation. Preserve and link any existing supported-outcome evidence here. Add a capability only after the complete process is confirmed at its claimed boundary.

A capability describes an end-to-end outcome the product or application can perform. For each capability, record the user or system outcome, inputs, main process, outputs, enabling features, durable source and verification refs, supported environments, and honest limitations.

Concrete implemented mechanisms belong in `{{OWNER_currentFeatures}}`. Current construction and responsibility boundaries belong in `{{OWNER_architecture}}`. Desired but unsupported outcomes belong in `{{OWNER_futureCapabilities}}`.
